<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-008" chapter-id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered" source-id="s-liangshu-008-current-rendered-zhaoming-opening">
  <p id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AAE">昭明太子統</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AAE">德施</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AA">高祖</persName>長子也。母曰<persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="neq_gso_1bv">丁貴嬪</persName>。初，<persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0005" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AA">高祖</persName>未有男，義師起，<persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0006" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AAE">太子</persName>以齊中興元年九月生于襄陽。<persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0007" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AA">高祖</persName>旣受禪，有司奏立儲副，<persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0008" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AA">高祖</persName>以天下始定，百度多闕，未之許也。羣臣固請，天監元年十一月，立爲皇<persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0009" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AAE">太子</persName>。時<persName id="c-liangshu-008-zhaoming-opening-rendered:p001:m0010" ref="cav_2xc_9bq_AAE">太子</persName>年幼，依舊居於內，拜東宮官屬文武，皆入直永福省。</p>
</text>
